{
  "description": "Go-produced vectors (pkg/evm/stawi) for the PersonalVault: id = StandingOrderID(book, pool, loan_id) = keccak256(abi.encode(\"STAWI_LOAN_STANDING_V1\", book, pool, loan_id)); a deposit is VaultDepositIntent(base, vault, pocket, amount): base as TRANSFER with destination {PERSONAL_VAULT, vault, bucket}, no room, the amount; bucket is \"\" for the free balance (pocket zero) or \"0x\" and the goal id in 64 lowercase hex digits; digest is the deposit intent's digest. A standing grant is a personal loan's standing order: LoanStandingParams (target the vault, selector receiveDeposit, authorization id StandingOrderID, period every_days x 86400, max_per_period rules.LargestInstalment(amount, terms), the policy asset) as the GRANT_STANDING op whose ManagementOpHash (keccak256(abi.encode(ManagementOp)), policy zero) is the AUTHORIZATION_GRANT intent's authorization_id; digest is that intent's digest. A standing revoke is the REVOKE_STANDING op {kind 11, key 0, authorization_id StandingOrderID, grant params and policy zero} whose ManagementOpHash is the AUTHORIZATION_REVOKE intent's authorization_id (no room, zero amount, the policy asset); digest is that intent's digest. An add key is the ADD_KEY op {kind 0, key} (ADD_KEY_P256: kind 12, the P-256 key id) with every other field zero, whose ManagementOpHash is the KEY_CHANGE intent's authorization_id (no room, no asset, zero amount, the account as source and destination); digest is that intent's digest.",
